{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122706","id":4335143394,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAmUJ4g","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122706","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122706.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122706.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122706","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122706/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122706/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122706/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b0e01c77b3f4e3d2f404da3a1d6b8d0fca6a587d","number":122706,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript VM: Reduce lookups in `_profile_count_as_native`","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`_profile_count_as_native()` currently does a total of three map look-ups:\r\n1. `ClassDB::class_exists()` checks if the class exists in the `classes` map.\r\n2. `ClassDB::has_method()` gets the class info from the `classes` map...\r\n3. ...then checks if the named method exists in the GDType's `method_map`.\r\n\r\nStep 2 already returns `false` when the class can't be found, meaning all step 1 does is to make code slower and nothing else.\r\n\r\n~~And thanks to #117599, we have direct access to the object's GDType, meaning step 2 may be skipped as well.~~\r\n\r\n**Update**: Per maintainer request, I've kept step 2 as `GDType` is too new and subject to big changes to be used outside of core. It might come back once it's more feature complete, but not on this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"